1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:06,110
The gear on the chart opens Chart Settings.

2
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:13,520
Appearance sets the chart colours: background, grid, and the up and down candles.

3
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:20,010
Price-axis countdown shows how long until the current candle closes.

4
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:23,420
The Trading page controls your trades on the chart.

5
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,780
Show picks which lines appear: positions, orders, both, or none.

6
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:32,140
Position Style draws each open trade as a full line or a small dot.

7
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:35,830
Reset to Defaults puts everything back. Close the window with the X.

